OL,3,GNEWSAMajor award for university's      
OL,4,Atransformation of Edinburgh hospital   
OL,6,FThe restoration of a Victorian hospital
OL,7,Fby a university in an "extraordinary   
OL,8,Ftransformation" has been awarded       
OL,9,FScotland's biggest architecture prize. 
OL,11,FThe University of Edinburgh transformed
OL,12,Fthe city's Old Royal Infirmary into a  
OL,13,F"radically collaborative space for     
OL,14,Flearning and research" that has few, if
OL,15,Fany, parallels in recent UK            
OL,16,Farchitecture.                          
OL,18,FThe NHS vacated the Category A-listed  
OL,19,Fbuilding in 2003 and it was purchased  
OL,20,Fby the university in 2015 to become the
OL,21,FEdinburgh Futures Institute.           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
