OL,3,GNEWSAMajor award for university's      
OL,4,Atransformation of Edinburgh hospital   
OL,6,FArchitects Bennetts Associates are     
OL,7,Fcredited with saving the Scottish      
OL,8,FBaronial structure from dereliction and
OL,9,Fhave now secured the prestigious Andrew
OL,10,FDoolan Best Building in Scotland Award.
